le":"Jeremiah 36:22","segments":["Now the king sat in the winterhouse in the ninth month: and [there was a fire] on the hearth burning before him."],"ref":"Jeremiah 36:22","verse":22,"words":[{"text":"Now the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" sat","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" in the winterhouse","strong":"H1004"},{"text":"","strong":"H2779"},{"text":" in the ninth","strong":"H8671"},{"text":" month","strong":"H2320"},{"text":": and [there was a fire] on the hearth","strong":"H254"},{"text":" burning","strong":"H1197"},{"text":" before","strong":"H6440"},{"text":" him."}]},{"id":19865,"title":"Jeremiah 36:23","segments":["And it came to pass, [that] when Jehudi had read three or four leaves, he cut it with the penknife, and cast [it] into the fire that [was] on the hearth, until all the roll was consumed in the fire that [was] on the hearth."],"ref":"Jeremiah 36:23","verse":23,"words":[{"text":"And it came to pass, [that] when Jehudi","strong":"H3065"},{"text":" had read","strong":"H7121"},{"text":" three","strong":"H7969"},{"text":" or four","strong":"H702"},{"text":" leaves","strong":"H1817"},{"text":", he cut","strong":"H7167"},{"text":" it with the penknife","strong":"H8593"},{"text":"","strong":"H5608"},{"text":", and cast","strong":"H7993"},{"text":" [it] into the fire","strong":"H784"},{"text":" that [was] on the hearth","strong":"H254"},{"text":", until all the roll","strong":"H4039"},{"text":" was consumed","strong":"H8552"},{"text":" in the fire","strong":"H784"},{"text":" that [was] on the hearth","strong":"H254"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19866,"title":"Jeremiah 36:24","segments":["Yet they were not afraid, nor rent their garments, [neither] the king, nor any of his servants that heard all these words."],"ref":"Jeremiah 36:24","verse":24,"words":[{"text":"Yet they were not afraid","strong":"H6342"},{"text":", nor rent","strong":"H7167"},{"text":" their garments","strong":"H899"},{"text":", [neither] the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":", nor any of his servants","strong":"H5650"},{"text":" that heard","strong":"H8085"},{"text":" all these words","strong":"H1697"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19867,"title":"Jeremiah 36:25","segments":["Nevertheless Elnathan and Delaiah and Gemariah had made intercession to the king that he would not burn the roll: but he would not hear them."],"ref":"Jeremiah 36:25","verse":25,"words":[{"text":"Nevertheless Elnathan","strong":"H494"},{"text":" and Delaiah","strong":"H1806"},{"text":" and Gemariah","strong":"H1587"},{"text":" had made intercession","strong":"H6293"},{"text":" to the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" that he would not burn","strong":"H8313"},{"text":" the roll","strong":"H4039"},{"text":": but he would not hear","strong":"H8085"},{"text":" them."}]},{"id":19868,"title":"Jeremiah 36:26","segments":["But the king commanded Jerahmeel the son of Hammelech, and Seraiah the son of Azriel, and Shelemiah the son of Abdeel, to take Baruch the scribe and Jeremiah the prophet: but the LORD hid them. {of Hammelech: or, of the king}"],"ref":"Jeremiah 36:26","verse":26,"words":[{"text":"But the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" commanded","strong":"H6680"},{"text":" Jerahmeel","strong":"H3396"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Hammelech","strong":"H4429"},{"text":", and Seraiah","strong":"H8304"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Azriel","strong":"H5837"},{"text":", and Shelemiah","strong":"H8018"},{"text":" the son","strong":"H1121"},{"text":" of Abdeel","strong":"H5655"},{"text":", to take","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" Baruch","strong":"H1263"},{"text":" the scribe","strong":"H5608"},{"text":" and Jeremiah","strong":"H3414"},{"text":" the prophet","strong":"H5030"},{"text":": but the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" hid","strong":"H5641"},{"text":" them. {of Hammelech: or, of the king}"}]},{"id":19869,"title":"Jeremiah 36:27","segments":["Then the word of the LORD came to Jeremiah, after that the king had burned the roll, and the words which Baruch wrote at the mouth of Jeremiah, saying,"],"ref":"Jeremiah 36:27","verse":27,"words":[{"text":"Then the word","strong":"H1697"},{"text":" of the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" came to Jeremiah","strong":"H3414"},{"text":", after","strong":"H310"},{"text":" that the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" had burned","strong":"H8313"},{"text":" the roll","strong":"H4039"},{"text":", and the words","strong":"H1697"},{"text":" which Baruch","strong":"H1263"},{"text":" wrote","strong":"H3789"},{"text":" at the mouth","strong":"H6310"},{"text":" of Jeremiah","strong":"H3414"},{"text":", saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":","}]},{"id":19870,"title":"Jeremiah 36:28","segments":["Take thee again another roll, and write in it all the former words that were in the first roll, which Jehoiakim the king of Judah hath burned."],"ref":"Jeremiah 36:28","verse":28,"words":[{"text":"Take","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" thee again","strong":"H7725"},{"text":" another","strong":"H312"},{"text":" roll","strong":"H4039"},{"text":", and write","strong":"H3789"},{"text":" in it all the former","strong":"H7223"},{"text":" words","strong":"H1697"},{"text":" that were in the first","strong":"H7223"},{"text":" roll","strong":"H4039"},{"text":", which Jehoiakim","strong":"H3079"},{"text":" the king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Judah","strong":"H3063"},{"text":" hath burned","strong":"H8313"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19871,"title":"Jeremiah 36:29","segments":["And thou shalt say to Jehoiakim king of Judah, Thus saith the LORD; Thou hast burned this roll, saying, Why hast thou written therein, saying, The king of Babylon shall certainly come and destroy this land, and shall cause to cease from thence man and beast?"],"ref":"Jeremiah 36:29","verse":29,"words":[{"text":"And thou shalt say","strong":"H559"},{"text":" to Jehoiakim","strong":"H3079"},{"text":" king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Judah","strong":"H3063"},{"text":", Thus saith","strong":"H559"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":"; Thou hast burned","strong":"H8313"},{"text":" this roll","strong":"H4039"},{"text":", saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Why hast thou written","strong":"H3789"},{"text":" therein, saying","strong":"H559"},{"text":", The king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Babylon","strong":"H894"},{"text":" shall certainly","strong":"H935"},{"text":" come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" and destroy","strong":"H7843"},{"text":" this land","strong":"H776"},{"text":", and shall cause to cease","strong":"H7673"},{"text":" from thence man","strong":"H120"},{"text":" and beast","strong":"H929"},{"text":"?"}]},{"id":19872,"title":"Jeremiah 36:30","segments":["Therefore thus saith the LORD of Jehoiakim king of Judah; He shall have none to sit upon the throne of David: and his dead body shall be cast out in the day to the heat, and in the night to the frost."],"ref":"Jeremiah 36:30","verse":30,"words":[{"text":"Therefore thus saith","strong":"H559"},{"text":" the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" of Jehoiakim","strong":"H3079"},{"text":" king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" of Judah","strong":"H3063"},{"text":"; He shall have none to sit","strong":"H3427"},{"text":" upon the throne","strong":"H3678"},{"text":" of David","strong":"H1732"},{"text":": and his dead body","strong":"H5038"},{"text":" shall be cast out","strong":"H7993"},{"text":" in the day","strong":"H3117"},{"text":" to the heat","strong":"H2721"},{"text":", and in the night","strong":"H3915"},{"text":" to the frost","strong":"H7140"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":19873,"title":"Jeremiah 36:31","segments":["And I will punish him and his seed and his servants for their iniquity; and I will bring upon them, and upon the inhabitants of Jerusalem, and upon the men of Judah, all the evil that I have pronounced against them; but they hearkened not. {punish: Heb. visit upon}"],"ref":"Jeremiah 36:31","verse":31,"words":[{"text":"And I will punish","strong":"H6485"},{"text":" him and his seed","strong":"H2233"},{"text":" and his servants","strong":"H5650"},{"text":